-## Implemented
-- Five input/source calibration profiles.
-- Separate fast transient and slow sustain sensing.
-- Four real signal-routing topologies.
-- Recorder-style Trim -> EQ -> Channel -> Master nonlinear staging.
-- Protected baritone/low-frequency drive path.
-- Level-dependent upper-frequency breakup/fray.
-- Independent wet-path filtering, compression, bias, distortion, ducking, gate, and bloom behavior.
-- Multi-timescale correlated wow/flutter/drift transport instability.
-- Original synthetic resonant/modeler layer.
-- Controlled near-feedback resonator.
-- Rebuilt factory presets using distinct source profiles and topologies.
-- Updated GUI with SOURCE, RIG and paged DEEP EDIT controls.
-- v0.3 Windows GitHub Actions workflow and failure reporting.
+## Patch scope
+- v0.3 architecture and tone design retained.
+- Fixes stale internal DSP state when wow/flutter, doubling, wet ambience, modeler, or near-feedback sections are reduced fully to zero and later re-enabled.
+- Safe Output now resets its gain state while disabled so re-enabling cannot inherit old attenuation.
+- No factory preset parameter values were changed by this patch.
 
