-Broken Machine is an original reactive guitar-processing VST3 for Windows/FL Studio. v0.3 expands the v0.2 research-driven architecture with input calibration, true multi-topology routing, a more structured recorder-style preamp, a more independent distorted ambience path, transient/sustain-aware modulation, original synthetic-resonance processing, and controlled near-feedback behavior.
+Broken Machine is an original reactive guitar-processing VST3 for Windows/FL Studio. v0.3.1 is the post-build stability patch for the v0.3 architecture. v0.3 expands the v0.2 research-driven architecture with input calibration, true multi-topology routing, a more structured recorder-style preamp, a more independent distorted ambience path, transient/sustain-aware modulation, original synthetic-resonance processing, and controlled near-feedback behavior.
 
 It is inspired by the *behaviors* found in unstable direct-recorded guitar rigs. It is not an official Mk.gee product and does not copy proprietary algorithms, presets, branding, artwork, or circuit schematics.
 
